'''Dogumaru''' (土偶戦士ドグ丸, ''Dogūsenshi Dogumaru'', '''Dogū Warrior Dogumaru''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemy introduced in [[Primitive Souls]], the final stage in [[Depths of My Heart]]. He is the enemy version of [[Dogumaru (Special Cat)|Dogumaru]]. He was added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]].

