==Enemy==
Dogumaru appears to be a half-human, half-horse clay statue bearing the green gem often found on Relic enemies. He attacks by charging a pulse before firing it at the ground, creating a green explosion. His red eyes glare during his attack animation.

This enemy behaves like a stronger version of [[Manic King Dragon (Enemy)|Manic King Dragon]], having greater stats, delivering [[Omni Strike|Omni Strikes]] that reach up to 700 range at a shorter but still high standing range of 500, as well as inflicting a 20-second curse. Due to his fast attacks, long reach and piercing range, it's difficult to attack him safely. His main weakness is his somewhat low DPS for a Relic, but keep in mind that in all of his appearances, Dogumaru is never alone. When introduced into 2~{{3c}}, his danger increases significantly and can no longer easily be beaten without a dedicated strategy or powerful [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]].

Despite levitating, Dogumaru is not considered a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy.

